  "questions": [
    {
      "boundary": "The broker boundary around Catalog Management. ecommerce-catalog-service and ecommerce-image-service move from Redpanda to Apache Kafka. The topics they produce (catalog.product.events, catalog.category.events, catalog.attribute.events) move to Kafka with them. ecommerce-product-query-service, ecommerce-category-query-service and ecommerce-tenant-service stay on Redpanda. Every consumer x topic binding between the two sides then crosses the Redpanda/Kafka boundary and has to be bridged by MirrorMaker 2. The image service reading catalog.product.events stays inside the boundary, because producer and consumer both move.",
